label ToiletClosed
[REPLACE] It is closed toilet. I open it.
[signal arg="Bathroom_ToiletOpen"]
[REPLACE] I see strange cylinder in the toilet. It looks like... [color=GREEN]a face[/color]
[end_timeline]
label ToiletOpened
[REPLACE] I take a strange cylinder from the toilet...
[i]Strange cylinder[/i] added to inventory
[end_timeline]
label HeadTaken
[REPLACE] There is nothing more inside the toilet
[end_timeline]